  "question": {
    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>XeF</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;reacts with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>SbF</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;to form <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msub><mi>XeF</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msub><mi>SbF</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></msub></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>?</mo></math>.&nbsp;",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "11",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Xenon tetrafluoride&nbsp;(<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>XeF</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math>) is&nbsp;square planar&nbsp;and acts as a fluoride donor with&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>SbF</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></math>.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>XeF</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;changes to the cation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi>XeF</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>+</mo></msup></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>SbF</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;changes to the anion&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi>SbF</mi><mn>6</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>-</mo></msup></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>XeF</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>SbF</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo>&#10230;</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi>XeF</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>+</mo></msup><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi>SbF</mi><mn>6</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>-</mo></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
